Baker–Harman small remainders

Extracted from gcd-shifted-sets at commit
cb6cd4f6c95edab17f182c0dd169625b83c63ad2.
The extraction changes module paths and the ShiftedGcd namespace to BakerHarman,
and separates the two shared definitions; it does not change the proof arguments.

Subsequent development in this repository adds the full unequal-weight Theorems 1
and 2, including weighted simultaneous approximation and a sharper lattice
induction with the original logarithmic degrees. Earlier theorem interfaces are
retained as specializations where the newer results subsume them. These additions
and refactorings go beyond the original extraction described above.

This project includes and adapts portions of OpenAI's math repository:
